   "en": "tore at her golden hair, and cried: 'Oh, by Jupiter! Is he really going to go — is this stranger really going to have made a mockery of my kingdom? Will no one bring out the weapons, chase after him with the whole city behind us, drag the ships down from the dockyards? Go — quickly, bring fire, hand out weapons, drive the oars!'",
